两秒截止、清理断言、并发或预算，尚未制作新候选。原macOS配对CPU/RSS失败、双平台原生/安装保留、真实更新/备份/事件/周期、FZ50许可等门禁保持。\n\n此PR以feature/0.1.10-windows-transparent-icons为base，保持草稿，不自动合并其他PR/main，不签名、发布、stable晋升或创建完成证书。Windows继续验收，Mac保持后台，切原生平台前需确认Windows隔离实例为0。\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:47:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T05:49:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f5f774dd47194fb2ea04a3b23e0ab3c75a71a6bd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/statuses/a7feba5fda9422cd177d31fefb18054b513524a2","head":{"label":"gzers:feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","ref":"feature/0.1.10-integration-candidate","sha":"a7feba5fda9422cd177d31fefb18054b513524a2","user":{"login":"gzers","id":22311504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers","html_url":"https://github.com/gzers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gzers/received_events","type":"User","user